details = "You arrive at the government palace. A police cordon prevents entry. You take out your notepad and pen and start writing: \"First they pushed, then they knocked over the barriers. I could smell blood and gunpowder. Wounded and dead. And, finally, the president's head rolled on the floor. A revolution.\""
